&lt;p&gt;Postman&#39;s EMEA Talent Acquisition team is dedicated to building exceptional teams. We are a collaborative, high-performing group that works in close partnership with business leaders and recruiters to proactively identify and engage the talent that will drive Postman&#39;s next phase of growth across the region.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Sourcer on our EMEA team, you will be the engine behind our talent pipelines — identifying, engaging, and qualifying exceptional candidates across a wide range of roles and functions. This is a pivotal role for someone who is passionate about finding talent others can&#39;t, crafting compelling outreach, and turning data into sourcing strategy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner closely with EMEA recruiters and hiring managers to develop and execute targeted sourcing strategies for open and pipeline roles across engineering, product, sales, and support functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and engage passive candidates through LinkedIn Recruiter, Boolean search, GitHub, talent databases, professional communities, and creative sourcing techniques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and maintain warm talent pipelines for critical and recurring roles, ensuring a steady flow of high-quality candidates before requisitions open.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct initial outreach and candidate screenings to assess interest, fit, and availability — delivering well-qualified, well-briefed candidates to the recruiting team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and report on sourcing metrics including outreach response rates, pipeline conversion, and time-to-slate to continuously improve approach and effectiveness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay current on EMEA talent market dynamics, competitor hiring activity, and regional compensation trends to inform sourcing strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to employer branding efforts by crafting compelling, personalized outreach messages that resonate with diverse candidate personas across EMEA markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3+ years of sourcing or recruiting experience, with a strong preference for candidates who have supported EMEA hiring across multiple countries and functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in sourcing tools and platforms, including LinkedIn Recruiter, Boolean search, Lusha, Apollo, GitHub, and other talent intelligence tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to engage passive candidates with personalized, compelling outreach — strong written communication skills are essential.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable navigating cultural nuances across different EMEA markets and tailoring your approach to local talent pools and expectations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data-driven mindset with the ability to track pipeline metrics, analyze sourcing effectiveness, and pivot strategies based on results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Highly organized and self-directed — able to manage multiple sourcing projects simultaneously in a fast-paced, distributed team environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting diversity sourcing initiatives and a genuine commitment to building inclusive candidate pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;4036&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot;&gt;What Else?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
