&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 10pt; font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1&gt;Clinical Manager (RN) – Adult &amp;amp; Pediatric Skilled Home Care&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care is seeking a Clinical Manager (RN) to join our Adult Nursing and Pediatric Skilled Home Care office in Erie, PA. This unique leadership opportunity combines direct client care with clinical oversight, allowing you to make a meaningful impact on both clients and caregivers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;At BAYADA, we believe our clients and their families deserve care delivered with compassion, excellence, and reliability. We are looking for a dedicated Registered Nurse who is passionate about clinical excellence, staff development, and providing exceptional care to medically complex adult and pediatric clients in the home setting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;isSelectedEnd&quot;&gt;If you&#39;re seeking the next step in your nursing career and are ready to grow into a clinical leadership role, we&#39;d love to hear from you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Responsibilities:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead, mentor, and motivate clinical staff to deliver outstanding patient care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct in-home client assessments throughout Erie, PA and surrounding communities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop individualized plans of care and oversee their implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide clinical supervision and support to field nurses&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with company policies, clinical standards, and regulatory requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate new hire orientation and onboarding activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct skills validations and competency assessments for new and tenured staff&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with office leadership to support quality outcomes and operational goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as a clinical resource for staff, clients, and families&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Qualifications:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Active Registered Nurse (RN) license required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 2 years of hands-on nursing experience required&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous home care, home health, pediatric, or skilled nursing experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supervisory or leadership experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tracheostomy and ventilator experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong assessment, communication, and organizational skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to build positive relationships with clients, families, and interdisciplinary teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Why Join BAYADA?&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Opportunity to combine clinical leadership with direct patient impact&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supportive and collaborative team environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ongoing training and professional development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Career growth opportunities within a nationally recognized healthcare organization&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Meaningful work serving adult and pediatric clients in the comfort of their homes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Join a company that is committed to helping people live safely at home while supporting your professional growth and leadership development.&lt;/p&gt;
